      "id": "claim_f305ee56c45140e2ba442322d8b2be01",
      "statement": "Core resolves the path through VirtualFilesystem before passing the resulting VirtualFile to the applet process creation code. The helper also recognizes split files and constructs a concatenated virtual file, so downstream loaders can consume a single file abstraction. Debug path opening at this boundary before changing a format loader.",
