      "id": "claim_eec7389cb8624759bb9b44287cecae23",
      "statement": "Loader::GetLoader first rejects a missing file and checks whether an indexed program can be resolved. It then identifies the file by content, consults the filename, and falls back to the filename type when content identification is unknown. A recognized deconstructed ExeFS directory can take precedence over interpreting its main binary as a lone NSO.",
