      "id": "claim_3d0f20d43f1741c680faa33794b294be",
      "statement": "The applet process creation implementation obtains an AppLoader and initializes an AM process with it. This is the seam between file-format handling and process construction. Loader status is propagated to the core launch path, where failed loads are cleaned up.",
